{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colossal rift has torn open in the fabric of reality\u2014the 26th Dimension is attacking the 27th Dimension! With unprecedented energy and alien technology, it strives to disrupt the order of the 27th Dimension and shake the balance of the multiverse. Yet all is not lost. In the midst of the chaos, the local deity of the 27th Dimension reaches out to you\u2014chosen, unique, ready for battle. You have been recruited, not just as a soldier, but as the defender of an entire alternate reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission starts now. Your fight will determine the fate of an entire dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 30 levels, including 3 boss battles. With 4 weapons you battle 8 enemies. The game blends modern pixelart with the 2D platformer run-and-gun game genre. Enemies move along random paths in the levels, so every run is different and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 difficulty levels with individual tuning options. After you finish the game, you can use the editor to decide in each level which enemies appear.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995750?t=1761469740","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995750/199ed77ff6f16f18e8e854c81422c3232c3746f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761469740","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995750/17ae042b34ac170216acb9e5a3865b393af54465/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761469740","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995750/17ae042b34ac170216acb9e5a3865b393af54465/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761469740","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colossal rift has torn open in the fabric of reality\u2014the 26th Dimension is attacking the 27th Dimension! With unprecedented energy and alien technology, it strives to disrupt the order of the 27th Dimension and shake the balance of the multiverse. Yet all is not lost. In the midst of the chaos, the local deity of the 27th Dimension reaches out to you\u2014chosen, unique, ready for battle. You have been recruited, not just as a soldier, but as the defender of an entire alternate reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission starts now. Your fight will determine the fate of an entire dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 30 levels, including 3 boss battles. With 4 weapons you battle 8 enemies. The game blends modern pixelart with the 2D platformer run-and-gun game genre. Enemies move along random paths in the levels, so every run is different and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 4 difficulty levels with individual tuning options. After you finish the game, you can use the editor to decide in each level which enemies appear.</p>","developers":["wARmAcH1n3"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995750/7a7f28b8aa8dea272a90ecfebf99b11ac7759ff3/header.jpg?t=1761469740","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights, title, and interest in the Game, including all content, code, artwork, sounds, and associated intellectual property, are owned by us or our licensors. This Agreement does not grant you any ownership rights.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou may not:<br />\r\n    \u2022 Distribute, sell, rent, lease, or s